      "id": "claim_268b537947194097ad72fba12e71ab0b",
      "statement": "The hybridQuery position-aware blend assigns RRF weight 0.75 to 1-indexed RRF ranks 1-3, 0.60 to ranks 4-10, and 0.40 to ranks 11 and beyond. structuredSearch applies the same buckets.",
