    {
      "id": "claim_0dc7619d3a6c44c6b8112506b2529d92",
      "statement": "In the blend step, a reranked file missing from the candidate rank map falls back to rrfRank = candidateLimit, which places it in the 0.40 bucket with positional score 1/candidateLimit; because reranked files come from the same candidates, this fallback is defensive.",
      "evidence": [
